Source: noctalia-greeter
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), meson, ninja-build, pkg-config,
 libstb-dev, libinput-dev, libwlroots-0.20-dev,
 wayland-protocols, libdrm-dev, libgbm-dev, libcairo2-dev,
 libcairo-ft-dev, libfontconfig-dev, libfreetype-dev, libjxl-dev,
 libwebp-dev, librsvg2-dev, libxml2-dev,
 libxkbcommon-dev, libudev-dev, libxcb1-dev,
 libxcb-ewmh-dev, libxcb-randr0-dev, libxcb-render0-dev,
 libxcb-shape0-dev, libxcb-xfixes0-dev, libgles-dev, libegl-dev,
 libglib2.0-dev, libpango1.0-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia-greeter

Package: noctalia-greeter
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 dbus, greetd
Recommends: polkit
Description: Login greeter for greetd with the Noctalia Shell look and feel
 A minimal login greeter for greetd that matches the look and feel of
 Noctalia Shell, built with wlroots. Compiled from the git snapshot.
